        "a": "Weddings and events for South Asian families in Atlanta — Indian, Pakistani, Ismaili and Muslim celebrations, including Mehndi, Sangeet, Baraat, Pheras, Nikah, Walima and receptions."
      },
      {
        "q": "Where do you work?",
        "a": "We're based in Atlanta, Georgia. If your celebration is elsewhere, ask us — we'll tell you honestly what's possible."
      },
      {
        "q": "Do you only do full planning?",
        "a": "No. We offer full planning, partial planning, day-of coordination, vendor management and decor & design direction. The celebration builder above suggests a starting point."
      },
      {
        "q": "How much does it cost?",
        "a": "Every celebration is different, so we quote after a short call about your events, guest count and the support you need."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can we use our own vendors?",
        "a": "Of course. We coordinate with the vendors you've chosen, and we can introduce trusted partners from our vendor circle where you need them."
      },
      {
        "q": "How early should we reach out?",
        "a": "As early as you can — popular weekends go first. Check your date below and send us a note; we'll call you back."
      },
      {
        "q": "What happens after I send an inquiry?",
        "a": "We read every inquiry personally and reach out by phone or WhatsApp to set up a first call."
      }
    ]
